In terms of size and proportions, they typically weigh between 60-70 pounds and stand around 22-24 inches tall at the shoulder. Their body is well-proportioned, with a deep chest and a strong, muscular build.

Unique identifying traits include their distinctive coat texture and color, facial structure, and overall body shape. They are easily distinguished from other breeds by these physical features.
